  "lessons": [
    {
      "contentKey": "ENG-A1-023-OBJECT-PRONOUNS",
      "slug": "eng-a1-023-object-pronouns",
      "sortOrder": 230,
      "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-OBJECT-PRONOUNS"],
      "prerequisiteContentKeys": ["ENG-A1-003-BE-AFFIRMATIVE"],
      "revision": {
        "title": "Ob'ekt olmoshlari: me, him, her, us, them",
        "description": "Fe'l yoki predlogdan keyin keladigan olmoshlar: I → me, he → him, ...",
        "activities": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Bugun nimani o'rganamiz?\n\nGap boshida **ega** olmoshi turadi (I, he, she...). Lekin fe'l yoki predlogdan **keyin** boshqa shakl kerak: *I see **him**.* (Men uni ko'raman.) Bu **ob'ekt olmoshlari**." }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 4,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Qoida\n\n| Ega (subject) | Ob'ekt (object) |\n| --- | --- |\n| I | **me** |\n| you | **you** |\n| he | **him** |\n| she | **her** |\n| it | **it** |\n| we | **us** |\n| they | **them** |\n\nOb'ekt olmoshi **fe'ldan** keyin (*She helps **me**.*) yoki **predlogdan** keyin (*Look at **them**.*) keladi." }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXAMPLE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "- I like **him**. (Men uni yoqtiraman.)\n- She helps **me**. (U menga yordam beradi.)\n- We can see **them**. (Biz ularni ko'ramiz.)\n- Please call **us**. (Iltimos, bizga qo'ng'iroq qiling.)\n- I know **her**." }
          },
          {
            "type": "MINI_QUESTION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-OBJECT-PRONOUNS"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "I like ___ . (u — erkak)", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "he" }, { "id": "b", "text": "him" }, { "id": "c", "text": "his" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["b"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Ko'p uchraydigan xato\n\n> Fe'ldan keyin **ega** olmoshini ishlatmang.\n>\n> Noto'g'ri: *I see he.* → To'g'ri: **I see him.**\n> Noto'g'ri: *She helps I.* → To'g'ri: **She helps me.**" }
          },
          {
            "type": "PRACTICE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-OBJECT-PRONOUNS"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-structured/v1", "format": "fill_blank", "prompt": "Bo'sh joyni to'ldiring (ob'ekt olmoshi, 'biz'): u bizga yordam beradi.", "segments": [ { "text": "She helps " }, { "blankId": "b1" }, { "text": "." } ], "blanks": { "b1": { "accepted": ["us"] } }, "normalization": { "caseFold": true, "collapseWhitespace": true }, "remediation": "we → us." }
          },
          {
            "type": "PRACTICE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-OBJECT-PRONOUNS"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-structured/v1", "format": "sentence_order", "prompt": "So'zlardan gap tuzing: men ularni ko'raman.", "tokens": [ { "id": "t1", "text": "I" }, { "id": "t2", "text": "can" }, { "id": "t3", "text": "see" }, { "id": "t4", "text": "them" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOrder": ["t1", "t2", "t3", "t4"] }, "remediation": "Ega + fe'l + ob'ekt olmoshi (they → them)." }
          },
          {
            "type": "PRACTICE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-OBJECT-PRONOUNS"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-structured/v1", "format": "fill_blank", "prompt": "Bo'sh joyni to'ldiring (ob'ekt olmoshi, 'u — ayol'): men uni bilaman.", "segments": [ { "text": "I know " }, { "blankId": "b1" }, { "text": "." } ], "blanks": { "b1": { "accepted": ["her"] } }, "normalization": { "caseFold": true, "collapseWhitespace": true }, "remediation": "she → her." }
          },
          {
            "type": "MASTERY_TEST",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-OBJECT-PRONOUNS"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-structured/v1", "format": "sentence_order", "prompt": "So'zlardan gap tuzing: iltimos, bizga qo'ng'iroq qiling.", "tokens": [ { "id": "t1", "text": "Please" }, { "id": "t2", "text": "call" }, { "id": "t3", "text": "us" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOrder": ["t1", "t2", "t3"] }, "remediation": "Please + fe'l + us." }
          },
          {
            "type": "MASTERY_TEST",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-OBJECT-PRONOUNS"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-structured/v1", "format": "fill_blank", "prompt": "Bo'sh joyni to'ldiring (ob'ekt olmoshi, 'u — erkak'): men uni yoqtiraman.", "segments": [ { "text": "I like " }, { "blankId": "b1" }, { "text": "." } ], "blanks": { "b1": { "accepted": ["him"] } }, "normalization": { "caseFold": true, "collapseWhitespace": true }, "remediation": "he → him." }
          },
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Xulosa\n\n- Fe'l/predlogdan keyin ob'ekt olmoshi: I→me, he→him, she→her, we→us, they→them.\n- *I see **him**. She helps **us**. Look at **them**.*" }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "contentKey": "ENG-A1-024-POSSESSIVE-S",
