      "revision": {
        "title": "Egalik 's: Ali's bag",
        "description": "Biror narsa kimga tegishli ekanini aytish: ot + 's.",
        "activities": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Bugun nimani o'rganamiz?\n\nBiror narsa **kimga tegishli**ligini aytish uchun odam ismiga **'s** qo'shiladi: *Ali**'s** bag* — Alining sumkasi. Bu **my/your** kabi egalik sifatlaridan farq qiladi." }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 4,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Qoida\n\n**Egasi (odam) + 's + narsa**\n\n| O'zbekcha | Inglizcha |\n| --- | --- |\n| Alining sumkasi | **Ali's** bag |\n| singlimning kitobi | my **sister's** book |\n| o'qituvchining mashinasi | the **teacher's** car |\n\n**Savol:** *Whose bag is this?* (Bu kimning sumkasi?) → *It's **Ali's**.*\n\n**Diqqat:** egalik **'s** (Ali's = Alining) va qisqartma **is** (*He's* = He is) yozilishi o'xshash, lekin ma'nosi boshqa." }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXAMPLE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "- This is **Ali's** bag.\n- It is my **sister's** book.\n- Where is the **teacher's** car?\n- **Dilnoza's** phone is new.\n- Whose pen is this? — It's **Aziz's**." }
          },
          {
            "type": "MINI_QUESTION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-POSSESSIVE-S"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "Alining sumkasi = ?", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "Ali bag" }, { "id": "b", "text": "Ali's bag" }, { "id": "c", "text": "bag's Ali" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["b"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Ko'p uchraydigan xato\n\n> Egasi (odam) **oldin**, keyin **'s**, keyin narsa keladi.\n>\n> Noto'g'ri: *the bag of Ali* (A1 uchun) / *bag's Ali* → To'g'ri: **Ali's bag**\n> Noto'g'ri: *my sister book* → To'g'ri: **my sister's book**" }
          },
          {
            "type": "PRACTICE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
